N rangestat.pkg
D  6 May 2021
U 8
d 'RANGESTAT': module to generate statistics using observations within range
d 
d  rangestat calculates statistics for each observation using all
d observations where a numeric key variable is within the low and
d high bounds defined for the current  observation. For panel data
d and time-series, rangestat can generate statistics over a rolling
d  window of time. In addition to its built-in statistics,
d rangestat can apply user-supplied Mata functions.
d 
d KW: range
d KW: statistics
d KW: rolling window
d KW: moving window
d KW: smoothing
d 
d Requires: Stata version 11
d 
d Distribution-Date: 20170511
d 
d Author: Robert Picard, NA
d Support: email picard@@netbox.com
d 
d Author: Nicholas J. Cox, Durham University
d Support: email N.J.Cox@@durham.ac.uk
d 
d Author: Roberto Ferrer, NA
d Support: email refp16@@gmail.com
d 
f r\rangestat.ado
f r\rangestat_run.ado
f r\rangestat.sthlp
e
