N nicelabels.pkg
D 23 Aug 2023
U 42
d 'NICELABELS': module for nice axis labels for general scales
d 
d      nicelabels suggests axis labels that would look nice on a
d graph using a general scale. It can help when,    for example,
d you want to choose the same labels for a series of graphs.
d Results are put in a local macro for   later use.   "Nice" is a
d little hard to define but easier to recognize. This command
d follows common practice in general and Heckbert (Graphics Gems
d 1990) in particular in selecting power-of-ten multiples of 1, 2
d or 5 that are equally spaced.
d 
d KW: graphics
d KW: axis labels
d 
d Requires: Stata version 9
d 
d Distribution-Date: 20220510
d 
d Author: Nicholas J. Cox, Durham University
d Support: email N.J.Cox@@durham.ac.uk
d 
f n\nicelabels.ado
f n\nicelabels.sthlp
